never let me join in the fight?

363
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:11,080
Clone trick!

364
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:16,520
Poor Greymon's been hit!

365
00:18:21,980 --> 00:18:23,220
No! WarGreymon!

366
00:18:24,540 --> 00:18:25,760
Get up!

367
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:27,786
Right, now who shall be next?

368
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:30,330
Tai!

369
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:31,440
Where are you?

370
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,470
Matt!

371
00:18:36,560 --> 00:18:38,340
Hold on, buddy! We're coming!

372
00:18:38,660 --> 00:18:39,680
