waiting for me to take target to practice.

376
00:18:49,540 --> 00:18:50,370
Tai!

377
00:18:50,453 --> 00:18:52,020
Matt, you made it.

378
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:53,967
I can't believe you're here.

379
00:18:54,220 --> 00:18:56,900
Yeah, I made it, Tai.
Hang in there, buddy.

380
00:18:58,060 --> 00:19:00,680
I never doubted you for a second, Matt.

381
00:19:01,060 --> 00:19:03,295
I know it didn't always seem that way.

382
00:19:04,380 --> 00:19:06,780
Thank you, Tai, for believing in me.

383
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:09,020
I'm just sorry I was so late.

384
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:12,437
Tai, you have to know how much our
friendship has always meant to me.

385
00:19:12,520 --> 00:19:15,579
