and brought War Greymon back to normal.

390
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:36,280
Thank you, Guru Roman.

391
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:37,934
Now I can fight again.

392
00:19:39,820 --> 00:19:41,577
Come on, guys, get out of there!

393
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:42,900
Tai, are you okay?

394
00:19:43,380 --> 00:19:44,360
I think so.

395
00:19:44,740 --> 00:19:48,897
My first thought was to destroy you all
together in one nice little package.

396
00:19:48,980 --> 00:19:51,277
But now I believe I'd
rather do it individually,

397
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:54,184
