400
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:15,650
Ah!

401
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:21,120
Digimon! Digimon!

402
00:20:21,660 --> 00:20:23,189
Digimon are the champions!

403
00:20:23,860 --> 00:20:25,640
Digimon, Digimon monsters!

404
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:27,389
Digimon are the champions!

405
00:20:27,820 --> 00:20:28,650
Digimon, Digimon monsters!

406
00:20:28,733 --> 00:20:29,563
