409
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:35,040
Digimon, Digimon!

410
00:20:35,340 --> 00:20:37,757
Monster friends with the Rides and Hells!

411
00:20:37,840 --> 00:20:39,977
They were able to break Kaibon's attack!

412
00:20:40,060 --> 00:20:40,890
Alright!

413
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,070
Well,

414
00:20:44,260 --> 00:20:48,907
could it actually be the case that I
finally found an adversary worth fighting?

415
00:21:11,320 --> 00:21:15,620
To be with you, I'm not afraid
to be able to get an adventure

416
00:21:16,260 --> 00:21:22,140
To be with you, I'm not afraid
to be afraid of my future

417
00:21:22,700 --> 00:21:25,053
I'm not afraid to be afraid of my future

418
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:28,880
To be with you, I'm not afraid
to be with you, I'm a smile

419
00:21:31,080 --> 00:21:36,120
I'm in the middle of
the heart, a weakly self

420
00:21:37,140 --> 00:21:40,417
I'll be able to get one more time,

421
00:21:40,500 --> 00:21:45,620
I'll be able to get one more time.

422
00:21:47,460 --> 00:21:51,460
I'll be able to fly with my courage.

423
00:21:52,020 --> 00:21:55,300
I'll be able to see my heart.

424
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:59,637
I'll be able to see my future.

425
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:02,520
Now I'm going to go to the sky

426
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:10,440
It's still starting to be a dream

427
00:22:12,720 --> 00:22:15,137
La La La

428
00:22:15,220 --> 00:22:20,157
La La La

429
00:23:00,320 --> 00:23:02,555
Now, the adventure is going to happen.
